    "density":   {
      "_comment": "P8.4 display density. Row height, control height, padding and gap per mode. Emitted into tokens.css as [data-density=\"mode\"] blocks by build-tokens.cjs, so these are real tokens: tokens:check covers them and the lint gates can see them. They lived in hand-written index.css until 2026-10-06, which meant no gate could catch a typo in them. Compact is gated to (pointer: fine) by the emitter, because 8.4 restricts it to fine pointers as a touch-safety rule: it shrinks rows to 38px while TaskRow keeps a 44px complete-task hit box, and the two overlap.",
